{"4346010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Necrofall", "steam_appid": 4346010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every swing matters.<br>Every mistake is fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torn from death and stripped of choice, you are forced to descend, to fight, and to fulfill a purpose buried deeper than memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise as an undead skeleton and fight your way through a decaying medieval world in this fast-paced first-person melee roguelike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BRUTAL FIRST-PERSON MELEE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast, skill-driven melee combat where precision and timing decide survival. Parry incoming blows, dodge at the last second, break enemy defenses, and punish from the shadows with devastating backstabs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/4bc29c9ac40c4c1f3275dea5cd975632.poster.avif?t=1776278651\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/4bc29c9ac40c4c1f3275dea5cd975632.webm?t=1776278651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/4bc29c9ac40c4c1f3275dea5cd975632.mp4?t=1776278651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FORGE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful upgrades and distinct weapon classes, from crushing greatswords to relentless dual blades. Shape a combat style that evolves every run as you adapt to whatever the dungeon throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/c785635a1b00a0a5d9574c241c8af84e.poster.avif?t=1776278651\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/c785635a1b00a0a5d9574c241c8af84e.webm?t=1776278651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/c785635a1b00a0a5d9574c241c8af84e.mp4?t=1776278651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DESCEND INTO THE UNKNOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons that blend procedural generation with handcrafted design. Face ever-changing paths across unique environments, from desolate outdoor landscapes to tight, claustrophobic interiors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/22bc64b5568602b10a888ebd974babdd.poster.avif?t=1776278651\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/22bc64b5568602b10a888ebd974babdd.webm?t=1776278651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/22bc64b5568602b10a888ebd974babdd.mp4?t=1776278651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Death is only the beginning.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>How deep can you go?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, skill-based first-person melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct weapons and powerful upgrades that reshape every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon layouts that blend procedural and handcrafted design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, dark, atmospheric environments to explore and conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless enemies and high-risk encounters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every swing matters.<br>Every mistake is fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torn from death and stripped of choice, you are forced to descend, to fight, and to fulfill a purpose buried deeper than memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise as an undead skeleton and fight your way through a decaying medieval world in this fast-paced first-person melee roguelike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BRUTAL FIRST-PERSON MELEE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast, skill-driven melee combat where precision and timing decide survival. Parry incoming blows, dodge at the last second, break enemy defenses, and punish from the shadows with devastating backstabs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/4bc29c9ac40c4c1f3275dea5cd975632.poster.avif?t=1776278651\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/4bc29c9ac40c4c1f3275dea5cd975632.webm?t=1776278651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/4bc29c9ac40c4c1f3275dea5cd975632.mp4?t=1776278651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FORGE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful upgrades and distinct weapon classes, from crushing greatswords to relentless dual blades. Shape a combat style that evolves every run as you adapt to whatever the dungeon throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/c785635a1b00a0a5d9574c241c8af84e.poster.avif?t=1776278651\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/c785635a1b00a0a5d9574c241c8af84e.webm?t=1776278651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/c785635a1b00a0a5d9574c241c8af84e.mp4?t=1776278651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DESCEND INTO THE UNKNOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons that blend procedural generation with handcrafted design. Face ever-changing paths across unique environments, from desolate outdoor landscapes to tight, claustrophobic interiors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/22bc64b5568602b10a888ebd974babdd.poster.avif?t=1776278651\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/22bc64b5568602b10a888ebd974babdd.webm?t=1776278651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/extras/22bc64b5568602b10a888ebd974babdd.mp4?t=1776278651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Death is only the beginning.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>How deep can you go?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, skill-based first-person melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct weapons and powerful upgrades that reshape every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon layouts that blend procedural and handcrafted design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, dark, atmospheric environments to explore and conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless enemies and high-risk encounters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Necrofall is a brutal medieval first-person melee roguelike where every swing matters. Rise as an undead skeleton, parry and backstab your way through ever-changing dungeons, and evolve your build with powerful, run-defining upgrades.", "supported_languages": "English, Italian, German, Japanese, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/cdf0a08f86d68f4bfb7d90273b12982c9865b2d3/header.jpg?t=1776278651", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/d5235976fac154d4c4a76062edc34512a5a8c8ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776278651", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346010/d5235976fac154d4c4a76062edc34512a5a8c8ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776278651", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i